      "scr_dup": "001",
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "本課程將完全用英語授課。 我強烈建議學生認為本課程是您從管理信息系統 (MIS) 的角度利用當代信息通信技術 (ICT) 為未來國際商務職業生涯的橋樑。 MIS 的成功應用已廣泛應用於許多業務領域，並以前所未有的速度繼續增長。 本課程的主要目的是為學生提供有關在不久的將來在商業應用領域中應用MIS的足夠背景知識。",
      "describe_en": "This course will be entirely taught in English. I strongly recommend the students to think that the course is the bridge for you to take advantage of contemporary Information Communication Technology (ICT) for future International Business career from Management Information System (MIS) point of view. The successful application of MIS has been widely applied in many business arena and it is continuing to grow in an unprecedented pace. The major objective of this course is to provide the students",
